  "text": "**TASK_096 Complete - Clank Code Review Integration**\n\nSuccessfully integrated clank's receiving-code-review skill into prepare-completion command output.\n\n**Key Files Modified**:\n- src/commands/prepare-completion.ts:189-218 - Core integration point\n- .claude/decision_log.md - Documented integration decision\n- .claude/tasks/TASK_096.md - Full task documentation with deviation justification\n\n**Testing Results**:\n- Codex code review caught 2 legitimate bugs I introduced:\n  1. Weakened \"Do not proceed\" safeguard → Fixed\n  2. Hard-coded \"Craig\" instead of \"the user\" → Fixed\n- This validates the code review integration is working!\n\n**Architecture Note**: \nThe prepare-completion command now has three distinct personas:\n1. Validation executor (runs checks)\n2. Review coordinator (calls Codex/CodeRabbit/Claude SDK)\n3. Instruction generator (tells future Claude how to receive feedback)\n\nThe clank integration enhances persona #3 with battle-tested patterns.",
